RootRegistry::_installRoot
├── given a fresh registry
│   └── when a scheme is installed
│       ├── it should mark the scheme installed
│       ├── it should initialize the scheme's credential
│       ├── it should emit RootValidatorInstalled
│       ├── it should report the scheme active immediately
│       └── it should authorize a signature from the installed signer (owner-check true)
└── given a scheme already installed
    └── when the same scheme is installed again
        └── it should revert with RootAlreadyInstalled
